==Battleground==
*1 [[The Face]] spawns.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*2 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*6 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*9 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*12 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 110 seconds<sup>3,300f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Brollow]]s spawn after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use units with Waves, Surges, or Explosions, like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross Cat]] or Talented [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to get rid of the Brollow and Owlbrow hordes, so that you get time to chip down The Face. If you don't have any, stacking Area Attackers like [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]] or [[Cameraman Cat]] to obliterate the Brollows and using rusher units like [[Courier Cat]] to deal with the Face and Owlbrows also works.

